139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399363 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399363 1071 "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -5 & 8 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nBy applying elementary row operations of the form ${R}_{i}:={R}_{i}+k{R}_{1},$ the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B.$ What are the elementary row operations?" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399363 1072 #uuid "fc4fe478-ecca-5d83-9a4b-47e34a0bc1c8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399363 1074 "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make the entries below ${a}_{12}=-2$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -5 & 8 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary row operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+{R}_{1}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399365 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399366 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399367 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399368 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399369 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399364 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399369 13194139533478 175