 system is now  \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x+4y=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$ and we have one free variable, $y.$ That means we need to find $x$  in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=-4y-3 \\\\ y=y,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-4y-3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399519 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399520 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399521 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399522 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399523 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399520 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399518 1080 #uuid "0a4567f4-6572-5d9e-8018-4068c6812f07" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399519 1081 "No solution" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399519 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399519 1084 #uuid "3d174f1e-8230-59a5-b790-dfbaab4e9521" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399520 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4y-3 \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399520 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399520 1084 #uuid "244aab6d-90be-578a-8092-166a36c8c9ba" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399521 1081 "[