}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x,$ and we have two free variables, $y$ and $z.$ That means we can find $x$ in terms of $y$ and $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement III is true." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399526 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399527 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399528 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399529 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399530 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399528 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399525 1080 #uuid "97478289-921c-5024-949c-f21308c68969" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399526 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399526 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399526 1084 #uuid "461eef6c-aefb-5663-8d03-db54f697d105" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399527 1081 "I only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399527 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399527 1084 #uuid "b3d3c662-b67b-5b81-a307-d2b8efde6388" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399528 1081 "III only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399528 1083 #edb/ref 175921860455